<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <!--
    Liveness probe for the three launchd KeepAlive servers: call-mode,
    doc-engine and quill-dictate. Every other agent on this Mac answers "did it
    fire recently"; those three need "is it up", and until this existed nothing
    could ask it. They are registered without being wrapped by
    bin/run-scheduled.sh on purpose (the wrapper records on child EXIT, and a
    KeepAlive child exiting means launchd restarted it), which left them honest
    and invisible at the same time.

    This probe turns "is it up" into a cadence: it records one run row per
    server per pass, so a down server becomes an incident on the same path every
    other failure takes, and a probe that stops running makes all three go stale
    for ops/edge-liveness.py to catch from GitHub.

    EVERY THIRTY MINUTES. These are interactive servers — dictation and the Doc
    conversation surface — so Joe finds out within seconds of reaching for one
    that is down. The probe exists to make that visible to the SYSTEM rather
    than to beat him to it. Thirty minutes matches the registered health
    cadence and avoids waking the metered record-layer database three times as
    often as the health contract requires.

    ITSELF WRAPPED, like every other scheduled job here: the probe's own failure
    has to be durable too, or the watcher becomes the one thing nothing watches.
  -->
  <key>Label</key><string>com.carr.keepalive-probe</string>

  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/zsh</string>
    <string>{{REPO}}/bin/run-scheduled.sh</string>
    <string>keepalive-probe</string>
    <string>launchd.run</string>
    <string>{{REPO}}/.venv/bin/python</string>
    <string>{{REPO}}/bin/probe-keepalive.py</string>
  </array>

  <!-- carr-launchd-interval-seconds: 1800 | rendered by lib/launchd_calendar.py; macOS 27 launchd never fires StartInterval -->
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <array>
    <dict><key>Minute</key><integer>0</integer></dict>
    <dict><key>Minute</key><integer>30</integer></dict>
  </array>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key><true/>
  <key>ThrottleInterval</key><integer>60</integer>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key><string>/opt/homebrew/opt/node@22/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/opt/homebrew/opt/libpq/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
  </dict>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>{{REPO}}/out/keepalive-probe.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>{{REPO}}/out/keepalive-probe.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
